          <zone h="20305" id="90" type-v2="text" w="100000" x="0" y="79695">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#333333" fontname="Arial" fontsize="11">Monthly Sales have no convincing time trend (linear p = .941). Clusters separate volume and profit profiles, not individual customers. Automatic is the forecast baseline: lower AIC, no unsupported trend. Units are USD; Customers sums simulated daily counts. Shading indicates 95% prediction intervals. Open Written Notes for full explanations, diagnostics and limitations.</run>
